# Marking KM → barcode lookup (grocery)

## Must

1. `ProductBarcodeScanVariants.of(raw)` expands DataMatrix КМ to GTIN-14 + consumer EAN via `ProductMarkingGtinExtractor` (same idea as `@aurent/shared-marking`).
2. Catalog/warehouse `search` and `barcodeContains` go through `ProductSearchMarkingNormalizer.forSearchOrBarcodeFilter` before specs — never LIKE the full KM string alone.
3. by-barcode (`ProductQueryServiceImpl.resolveByBarcode`, `CatalogProductBarcodeFinder`) keeps using `ProductBarcodeScanVariants.of`.

## Must NOT

- Treat plain EAN-8/13 or bare 14–17 digit ИКПУ as marking.
- Drop pack GTIN → consumer EAN-13 (`ean13FromPackGtin14`) when indicator is 1–8.
- Put new KM parsing only in the cashier frontend and leave backend search/by-barcode raw.
